{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"for-llms","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For LLMs"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every page of this site is also served as markdown, and the whole set is served\nas two plain-text files. They come from the same parse as the pages you are\nreading, in the same build, so they cannot drift."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana is new enough that a model's training data does not contain it. Pointing\na coding agent at these files is the difference between it writing Kirana and it\nwriting something that looks like Tailwind."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-endpoints","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The endpoints"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"URL"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What it is"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"/llms.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">txt</span>","source":"/llms.txt"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The index: one line per page, with its description and a link to that page's markdown"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"/llms-full.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">txt</span>","source":"/llms-full.txt"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every page, in reading order, as one file"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/</span>&lt;<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">path</span>&gt;.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/<path>.md"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"One page as markdown, such as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/styling</span>/merging.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/styling/merging.md"}}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/index</span>.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/index.md"}},{"type":"text","value":" is the introduction. The markdown twin of a page carries its\ntitle and canonical URL in a two-line header, then the page body exactly as it\nwas written."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"which-one-to-use","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which one to use"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"/llms.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">txt</span>","source":"/llms.txt"}},{"type":"text","value":" first."}]},{"type":"text","value":" It is small, and it lets an agent choose the pages it\nactually needs rather than spending its context on all of them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A single page"}]},{"type":"text","value":" when you know the topic. Merging, precedence, conditions and\nthe API reference answer most questions on their own."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"/llms-full.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">txt</span>","source":"/llms-full.txt"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" when you want the whole documentation in one context\nwindow, or when you are building an index of your own."}]},{"type":"component","name":"callout","tagName":"md-callout","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/start</span>/mental-model.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/start/mental-model.md"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/styling</span>/styles.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/styling/styles.md"}},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/styling</span>/merging.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/styling/merging.md"}},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-literal\">/docs/reference</span>/api.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">md</span>","source":"/docs/reference/api.md"}},{"type":"text","value":" cover the parts an\nagent gets wrong without them: that styles are typed objects, that conditions\nlive inside the value, and that a later style replaces entries rather than\nwhole properties."}]}],"properties":{"kind":"tip","title":"Start with these four"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"giving-an-agent-the-rules","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Giving an agent the rules"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The documentation explains Kirana; it does not, by itself, stop an agent\nreaching for habits from other systems. The "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/project/agent-skills","children":[{"type":"text","value":"agent skills"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\ndo that part: install them, and the agent loads the rules, the\ncheck-trace-report loop and the diagnostics reference by itself. The four rules worth stating outright in\nyour own prompt or project instructions:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Styles are "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">css</span>({ ... })","source":"css({ ... })"}},{"type":"text","value":" handles. There is no "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"cn","source":"cn"}},{"type":"text","value":", no\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"class-variance-authority","source":"class-variance-authority"}},{"type":"text","value":", and no utility-class strings."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Conditions go "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"inside the value"}]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-property\">color</span>: { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">base</span>: a, <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;:hover&quot;</span>: b }","source":"color: { base: a, \":hover\": b }"}},{"type":"text","value":", not a\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":":hover","source":":hover"}},{"type":"text","value":" key at the top level."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark mode is a "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">light-dark</span>()","source":"light-dark()"}},{"type":"text","value":" pair on the token. There is no "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-attr\">dark:</span>","source":"dark:"}},{"type":"text","value":" variant\nand no second stylesheet."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A later style "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"replaces the entries it names"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and keeps the rest. To drop a\nproperty's other entries, write "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"{ <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;*&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-literal\">null</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-property\">base</span>: ... }","source":"{ \"*\": null, base: ... }"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Everything the compiler can catch, it catches: a mistake in any of these is a\ndiagnostic with a code, not a silently wrong style. The\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/diagnostics","children":[{"type":"text","value":"diagnostics reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":" lists all of them, and it is\nworth handing to an agent alongside the pages above."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"machine-readable-extras","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Machine-readable extras"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The diagnostics are also available as data on the\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/diagnostics","children":[{"type":"text","value":"diagnostics page"}]},{"type":"text","value":": code, message, and what to do\nabout it."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/cli#kirana-export","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span>","source":"kirana export"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" prints your project's own\ndesign system (tokens, themes, recipes and relations, with where each is\ndeclared) as JSON, so an agent uses the names that exist."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/reference/api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":" is generated from the packages'\ntype declarations, so its signatures are the real ones."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"link","href":"/play","children":[{"type":"text","value":"playground"}]},{"type":"text","value":" shows curated examples with the CSS, class names and\ndiagnostics the real compiler produced from them at build time. It does not\ncompile pasted source yet (that needs the WASM engine), so to check an agent's\nsuggestion, run "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> build","source":"kirana build"}},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> check","source":"kirana check"}},{"type":"text","value":" on it."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"for-llms","text":"For LLMs","level":1},{"id":"the-endpoints","text":"The endpoints","level":2},{"id":"which-one-to-use","text":"Which one to use","level":2},{"id":"giving-an-agent-the-rules","text":"Giving an agent the rules","level":2},{"id":"machine-readable-extras","text":"Machine-readable extras","level":2}]}
